Author: Papa Diop <76528706+LordThiouk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 26 16:06:35 2026 +0000

    fix(build): align Rider Android toolchain to Flutter 3.50.1 (Gradle 8.14, AGP 8.11.1, Kotlin 2.3.0, Crashlytics 3.0.3)
    
    Rider was on Gradle 9.1.0 / AGP 9.0.1 / Kotlin 2.2.20 / Crashlytics 3.0.7,
    which Flutter 3.50.1 rejects (Artemis rider-apk-gradle red, unitaires verts).
    Aligned to Driver's working toolchain (Gradle 8.14 + AGP 8.11.1 + Kotlin 2.3.0
    + Crashlytics 3.0.3), google-services 4.3.15 unchanged, Firebase/Crashlytics kept.
    No lib/ changes. No flutter build/gradlew run on box.

